@InfoDynamics.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7293

### Crear usuario
POST {{InfoDynamics.API_HostAddress}}/api/usuario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noUsuario": 1234567,
  "nombre": "Luis",
  "apPaterno": "Perez",
  "apMaterno": "Lopez",
  "email": "luis@test.com",
  "rol": "Administrador",
  "contrasena": "AbC123@m@xyZ@S"
}

### Intento fallido 1
POST {{InfoDynamics.API_HostAddress}}/api/LogIn/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "1234567",
  "contrasena": "mal123"
}